-day average of 849K. It didn't hold. By Oct 28, 2020 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $90.49.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}